   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<h2 id=\"working-at-meridian-title\">Working at Meridian</h2>\n<h3>Shifts that fit</h3>\n<p>The airport runs 24 hours, so many roles are shift-based. We publish rotas 6 weeks ahead and you can swap shifts with colleagues through the staff app.</p>\n<h3>Getting to work</h3>\n<p>Free staff parking at Mid-Stay, and half-price rail travel from Birmingham Central for everyone on our payroll.</p>\n<h3>Training</h3>\n<p>Every new starter gets paid training before their first shift. Most of our managers started in frontline roles.</p>\n<h3>Pay and benefits</h3>\n<ul><li>Pay reviewed every April</li><li>25 days' holiday plus bank holidays, rising to 28 with service</li><li>Pension with up to 8% employer contribution</li><li>Free meals on shift in the staff canteen</li></ul>"
   }
  },
